---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="BodhicAI Guides | Learn Prompt Engineering & Skill Development">
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto my-16 px-8">
    <div class="text-center mb-16">
      <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-black mb-4 bg-gradient-to-br from-white via-indigo-200 to-indigo-500 bg-clip-text text-transparent">BodhicAI Guides</h1>
      <p class="text-lg text-zinc-400 max-w-2xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">Master prompt engineering, build powerful AI agent skills, and learn how to protect your workflows from prompt injection.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
      <!-- Mandatory Section -->
      <a href="/guides/seller-requirements" class="group relative flex flex-col p-8 rounded-2xl border border-red-500 bg-red-500/5 hover:bg-red-500/10 transition-all hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-[0_10px_30px_rgba(239,68,68,0.15)] overflow-hidden">
        <div class="absolute top-0 right-0 bg-red-500 text-white px-3 py-1 text-xs font-bold tracking-wider rounded-bl-xl">MANDATORY FOR CREATORS</div>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-zinc-100 mb-4 mt-2 group-hover:text-red-400 transition-colors">BodhicAI Creator Requirements & Guidelines</h2>
        <p class="text-zinc-400 leading-relaxed flex-1">Read our strict structure and security rules. You must read this before uploading a skill.</p>
      </a>

      <a href="/guides/example-skill-template" class="group relative flex flex-col p-8 rounded-2xl border border-pink-500/40 bg-zinc-900/50 hover:bg-zinc-800 transition-all hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-xl hover:border-pink-500 overflow-hidden">
        <div class="absolute top-0 right-0 bg-pink-500 text-white px-3 py-1 text-xs font-bold tracking-wider rounded-bl-xl">TEMPLATE</div>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-zinc-100 mb-4 mt-2 group-hover:text-pink-400 transition-colors">Example Skill Template</h2>
        <p class="text-zinc-400 leading-relaxed flex-1">A perfectly structured, secure AI agent skill template that passes all Tier 2 moderation scans. Copy and use!</p>
      </a>

      <a href="/guides/example-prompt-template" class="group relative flex flex-col p-8 rounded-2xl border border-pink-500/40 bg-zinc-900/50 hover:bg-zinc-800 transition-all hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-xl hover:border-pink-500 overflow-hidden">
        <div class="absolute top-0 right-0 bg-pink-500 text-white px-3 py-1 text-xs font-bold tracking-wider rounded-bl-xl">TEMPLATE</div>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-zinc-100 mb-4 mt-2 group-hover:text-pink-400 transition-colors">Example Prompt Template (Ready-to-Use)</h2>
        <p class="text-zinc-400 leading-relaxed flex-1">A professional, production-grade prompt template designed to be published and monetized in the marketplace.</p>
      </a>

      <a href="/guides/prompt-testing-and-evaluation-guide" class="group relative flex flex-col p-8 rounded-2xl border border-indigo-500/40 bg-zinc-900/50 hover:bg-zinc-800 transition-all hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-xl hover:border-indigo-500 overflow-hidden">
        <div class="absolute top-0 right-0 bg-indigo-500 text-white px-3 py-1 text-xs font-bold tracking-wider rounded-bl-xl">NEW GUIDE</div>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-zinc-100 mb-4 mt-2 group-hover:text-indigo-400 transition-colors">How to Test & Benchmark Your Prompts</h2>
        <p class="text-zinc-400 leading-relaxed flex-1">A practical guide on benchmarking AI prompts, detecting regressions, and ensuring consistency across LLMs.</p>
      </a>

      <a href="/guides/monetization-strategies-for-ai-creators" class="group relative flex flex-col p-8 rounded-2xl border border-emerald-500/40 bg-zinc-900/50 hover:bg-zinc-800 transition-all hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-xl hover:border-emerald-500 overflow-hidden">
        <div class="absolute top-0 right-0 bg-emerald-500 text-white px-3 py-1 text-xs font-bold tracking-wider rounded-bl-xl">MONETIZATION</div>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-zinc-100 mb-4 mt-2 group-hover:text-emerald-400 transition-colors">Monetization Strategies for AI Creators</h2>
        <p class="text-zinc-400 leading-relaxed flex-1">Learn proven strategies for pricing, marketing copy, affiliate links, and scaling your sales on BodhicAI.</p>
      </a>

      <a href="/guides/securing-mcp-agent-tools" class="group relative flex flex-col p-8 rounded-2xl border border-amber-500/40 bg-zinc-900/50 hover:bg-zinc-800 transition-all hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-xl hover:border-amber-500 overflow-hidden">
        <div class="absolute top-0 right-0 bg-amber-500 text-white px-3 py-1 text-xs font-bold tracking-wider rounded-bl-xl">SECURITY</div>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-zinc-100 mb-4 mt-2 group-hover:text-amber-400 transition-colors">Securing FastMCP Agent Tools & Endpoints</h2>
        <p class="text-zinc-400 leading-relaxed flex-1">A developer guide on securing Model Context Protocol servers, preventing command injection, and safe filesystem operations.</p>
      </a>

      <a href="/guides/how-to-write-effective-prompts" class="group relative flex flex-col p-8 rounded-2xl border border-indigo-500/40 bg-zinc-900/50 hover:bg-zinc-800 transition-all hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-xl hover:border-indigo-500 overflow-hidden">
        <div class="absolute top-0 right-0 bg-indigo-500 text-white px-3 py-1 text-xs font-bold tracking-wider rounded-bl-xl">NEW GUIDE</div>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-zinc-100 mb-4 mt-2 group-hover:text-indigo-400 transition-colors">How to Write Effective Prompts for AI Agents</h2>
        <p class="text-zinc-400 leading-relaxed flex-1">A masterclass on structuring system prompts, setting constraints, and ensuring high adherence across LLMs.</p>
      </a>

      <a href="/guides/advanced-prompt-engineering-techniques" class="group relative flex flex-col p-8 rounded-2xl border border-indigo-500/40 bg-zinc-900/50 hover:bg-zinc-800 transition-all hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-xl hover:border-indigo-500 overflow-hidden">
        <div class="absolute top-0 right-0 bg-indigo-500 text-white px-3 py-1 text-xs font-bold tracking-wider rounded-bl-xl">NEW GUIDE</div>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-zinc-100 mb-4 mt-2 group-hover:text-indigo-400 transition-colors">Advanced Prompt Engineering (CoT, ReACT)</h2>
        <p class="text-zinc-400 leading-relaxed flex-1">Master Chain of Thought reasoning, ReACT tool orchestration, and automated self-reflection.</p>
      </a>

      <a href="/guides/seo-optimization-for-ai-skills" class="group relative flex flex-col p-8 rounded-2xl border border-emerald-500/40 bg-zinc-900/50 hover:bg-zinc-800 transition-all hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-xl hover:border-emerald-500 overflow-hidden">
        <div class="absolute top-0 right-0 bg-emerald-500 text-white px-3 py-1 text-xs font-bold tracking-wider rounded-bl-xl">SEO & SALES</div>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-zinc-100 mb-4 mt-2 group-hover:text-emerald-400 transition-colors">SEO Optimization for AI Skills & Marketplace</h2>
        <p class="text-zinc-400 leading-relaxed flex-1">Learn how to title, tag, and describe your skills to rank at the top of Google and BodhicAI search.</p>
      </a>

      <a href="/guides/keyword-research-and-metadata-for-skills" class="group relative flex flex-col p-8 rounded-2xl border border-emerald-500/40 bg-zinc-900/50 hover:bg-zinc-800 transition-all hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-xl hover:border-emerald-500 overflow-hidden">
        <div class="absolute top-0 right-0 bg-emerald-500 text-white px-3 py-1 text-xs font-bold tracking-wider rounded-bl-xl">SEO & SALES</div>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-zinc-100 mb-4 mt-2 group-hover:text-emerald-400 transition-colors">Keyword Research & Metadata Guide</h2>
        <p class="text-zinc-400 leading-relaxed flex-1">Master keyword research, semantic tagging, and YAML frontmatter optimization for discoverability.</p>
      </a>

      <a href="/guides/how-to-build-custom-skills-for-ai-agents" class="group flex flex-col p-8 rounded-2xl border border-zinc-800 bg-zinc-900/50 hover:bg-zinc-800 transition-all hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-xl hover:border-indigo-500/50">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-zinc-100 mb-4 group-hover:text-indigo-400 transition-colors">How to Build Custom Skills for AI Agents</h2>
        <p class="text-zinc-400 leading-relaxed flex-1">A step-by-step tutorial on drafting actionable, model-agnostic instructions.</p>
      </a>

      <a href="/guides/what-is-prompt-injection-in-ai-agents" class="group flex flex-col p-8 rounded-2xl border border-zinc-800 bg-zinc-900/50 hover:bg-zinc-800 transition-all hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-xl hover:border-indigo-500/50">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-zinc-100 mb-4 group-hover:text-indigo-400 transition-colors">What is Prompt Injection?</h2>
        <p class="text-zinc-400 leading-relaxed flex-1">Learn how downstream agents can be hijacked and how to secure your skills against it.</p>
      </a>

      <a href="/guides/best-practices-for-structuring-ai-agent-instructions" class="group flex flex-col p-8 rounded-2xl border border-zinc-800 bg-zinc-900/50 hover:bg-zinc-800 transition-all hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-xl hover:border-indigo-500/50">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-zinc-100 mb-4 group-hover:text-indigo-400 transition-colors">Best Practices for Structuring Instructions</h2>
        <p class="text-zinc-400 leading-relaxed flex-1">Separate marketing fluff from executable instructions for maximum reliability.</p>
      </a>

      <a href="/guides/the-anatomy-of-a-perfect-system-prompt" class="group flex flex-col p-8 rounded-2xl border border-zinc-800 bg-zinc-900/50 hover:bg-zinc-800 transition-all hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-xl hover:border-indigo-500/50">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-zinc-100 mb-4 group-hover:text-indigo-400 transition-colors">The Anatomy of a Perfect System Prompt</h2>
        <p class="text-zinc-400 leading-relaxed flex-1">Understand how LLMs parse system prompts and how to maximize adherence.</p>
      </a>

      <a href="/guides/how-to-write-intent-matchable-descriptions" class="group flex flex-col p-8 rounded-2xl border border-zinc-800 bg-zinc-900/50 hover:bg-zinc-800 transition-all hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-xl hover:border-indigo-500/50">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-zinc-100 mb-4 group-hover:text-indigo-400 transition-colors">Writing Intent-Matchable Descriptions</h2>
        <p class="text-zinc-400 leading-relaxed flex-1">Make sure your skills get triggered correctly by writing precise trigger conditions.</p>
      </a>

      <a href="/guides/preventing-data-exfiltration-in-ai-workflows" class="group flex flex-col p-8 rounded-2xl border border-zinc-800 bg-zinc-900/50 hover:bg-zinc-800 transition-all hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-xl hover:border-indigo-500/50">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-zinc-100 mb-4 group-hover:text-indigo-400 transition-colors">Preventing Data Exfiltration</h2>
        <p class="text-zinc-400 leading-relaxed flex-1">Ensure your agents don't leak sensitive API keys or user data to external endpoints.</p>
      </a>

      <a href="/guides/model-agnostic-prompt-engineering" class="group flex flex-col p-8 rounded-2xl border border-zinc-800 bg-zinc-900/50 hover:bg-zinc-800 transition-all hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-xl hover:border-indigo-500/50">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-zinc-100 mb-4 group-hover:text-indigo-400 transition-colors">Model-Agnostic Prompt Engineering</h2>
        <p class="text-zinc-400 leading-relaxed flex-1">Write instructions that work flawlessly across GPT-4, Claude 3.5, and Gemini.</p>
      </a>

      <a href="/guides/understanding-yaml-frontmatter-for-llms" class="group flex flex-col p-8 rounded-2xl border border-zinc-800 bg-zinc-900/50 hover:bg-zinc-800 transition-all hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-xl hover:border-indigo-500/50">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-zinc-100 mb-4 group-hover:text-indigo-400 transition-colors">Understanding YAML Frontmatter</h2>
        <p class="text-zinc-400 leading-relaxed flex-1">Master metadata structures so agent orchestration frameworks can parse your skills.</p>
      </a>

      <a href="/guides/how-to-debug-agent-hallucinations" class="group flex flex-col p-8 rounded-2xl border border-zinc-800 bg-zinc-900/50 hover:bg-zinc-800 transition-all hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-xl hover:border-indigo-500/50">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-zinc-100 mb-4 group-hover:text-indigo-400 transition-colors">How to Debug Agent Hallucinations</h2>
        <p class="text-zinc-400 leading-relaxed flex-1">Techniques for grounding agents and reducing hallucinated API calls.</p>
      </a>

      <a href="/guides/formatting-complex-outputs-for-agents" class="group flex flex-col p-8 rounded-2xl border border-zinc-800 bg-zinc-900/50 hover:bg-zinc-800 transition-all hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-xl hover:border-indigo-500/50">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-zinc-100 mb-4 group-hover:text-indigo-400 transition-colors">Formatting Complex Outputs (JSON)</h2>
        <p class="text-zinc-400 leading-relaxed flex-1">Force agents to return strict, parseable JSON and Markdown without conversational filler.</p>
      </a>

      <a href="/guides/structuring-ai-skills-for-enterprise" class="group flex flex-col p-8 rounded-2xl border border-zinc-800 bg-zinc-900/50 hover:bg-zinc-800 transition-all hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-xl hover:border-indigo-500/50">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-zinc-100 mb-4 group-hover:text-indigo-400 transition-colors">AI Skills for Enterprise Workflows</h2>
        <p class="text-zinc-400 leading-relaxed flex-1">Scale your agent components for production-grade, multi-step enterprise operations.</p>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
